The redistributed files, both attributed to the TPTP and both carried unmodified:

    priv/bnf/SyntaxBNF-v9.3.1.2
        The TPTP syntax BNF, version 9.3.1.2, taken as plain text from
        https://tptp.org/UserDocs/TPTPLanguage/SyntaxBNF.html
        sha256 2c8d5be6e4feee13279c34de6dadd37904283d505c086e2fe2e2da18efaf54ee

    priv/szs/SZSOntology-2026-08-31.html
        The SZS ontology page, fetched on 2026-08-31 from
        https://tptp.org/UserDocs/SZSOntology
        sha256 22b1f4f9294331e062a630fc589bef8fd43422f3d3b9c6ac4ce11b3fe949f359

Both are vendored so that installing this package needs no network access. The BNF
is the text content of its page character for character, with no trailing newline;
the ontology is its page's markup byte for byte. Nothing in this repository edits
either file. The files under lib/ and src/ that are derived from them are produced
by `mix tptp.gen` and are regenerated rather than hand-maintained.

Note that the BNF served by SeeTPTP under Category=Documents lags the UserDocs page:
at the time of writing it is version 9.3.0.4. The UserDocs page above is the source
to check against, not that one.

